Subject: [PATCH 3/4] wifi: brcmfmac: complete mailbox IRQ and startup dependencies

Adapt MSI startup, capability-selected doorbells and pre-download masking
from AsahiLinux/linux 77cb8f24c2381a8abb7272d7bbdec548d6426a8a.
Separate ring readiness from IRQ masking and latch sampled status so neither
MSI auto-clear nor the top-half/thread interval loses a completion.
Use the existing fixed PCIe enumeration aperture for PCIe registers. Preserve firmware ownership on
an early IRQ-request failure and drain IRQs before teardown.
Experimental; no hardware validation.

